-- A program whose `update` and `view` are in a module of the project's own
-- platform layer, mounted from `Main` (docs/design/browser-inline.md §8.3,
-- amended 2026-10-19): the write-set pass reads a layer module as the
-- program's own code, so each key's pass calls the bindings its write
-- reaches. Its model is an `Int`. Before, the pass skipped the layer and the
-- handler called no binding: the count stayed at 0 in a release build.
import Browser
import Demo
import Tea


main : Tea.Program
main = Browser.mountAt Demo.demo "root"
